What is kept: how a schema is walked into structs and their fields (src/analyzer.rs,
from kopium's analyzer.rs), and how containers are named, deduplicated and their
fields renamed (src/output.rs, from kopium's output.rs), with kopium's tests of them.

What is changed: an enumerated string is a `String`, not an enum; only CRDs passed in
are read (no cluster, no command line); the output is plain serde structs with the
resource traits of k8s-openapi, not kube-rs's derives; case conversion, escaping and
doc comments are written here instead of using heck, syn and regex; errors are typed;
there is no logging.
